WFV43_MESSAGE("HUD.MoraleLeft","士气 %.0f","MORALE %.0f")
WFV43_MESSAGE("HUD.MoraleRight","%.0f 士气","%.0f MORALE")
WFV43_MESSAGE("HUD.FieldNotes","战术要点","Field notes")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U0","老兵把六支 SMLE 带上火线。\n六人步枪班，适合占领战壕、接替守军。开阔地上的机枪与炮火能迅速削弱整班兵力。","Six SMLEs and the men to hold a trench.\nA six-man rifle section for taking ground and relieving defenders. Machine guns and shellfire can cut it down in the open.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U0","Gewehr 98 守住白垩坡上的长射界。\n六人步枪班，适合据壕射击。射程略长于英军，射击间隔也更长；推进时需要火力掩护。","Gewehr 98s command the long chalk approaches.\nA six-man rifle section suited to trench defence. Its rifles outrange the British slightly, with a slower firing cycle. Advances need covering fire.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U1","弹盘送到枪旁，刘易斯守住通路。\n一名机枪手与两名步枪手。架设后以远射和压制掩护步兵；转移、换盘会中断射击，精确射手威胁枪手。","A fresh drum beside the Lewis, an approach under its sights.\nOne machine gunner and two riflemen. Deployed fire covers infantry at range. Moving and reloading interrupt fire; marksmen threaten the gunner.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U1","MG 08/15 的弹带穿过枪组手中。\n一名机枪手与两名步枪手。架设后以持续点射封锁通路；转移较慢，烟幕与炮击能压住枪位。","An MG 08/15 crew feeds another belt.\nOne machine gunner and two riflemen. Sustained bursts close an approach once deployed. Slow to move and vulnerable to smoke and shellfire.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U2","Mills 手雷先越过壕角。\n四人投弹班，擅长近距离清壕。手雷也能损伤履带，散布会危及附近友军；接近时需要掩护。","The Mills bomb goes over the traverse first.\nFour bombers for close trench fighting. Their grenades can damage tracks, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies. They need cover on the approach.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U2","柄式手榴弹为突击手打开壕口。\n四人突击班，擅长近距离清壕，也能威胁履带。远处机枪可阻断接近，烟幕有助于缩短距离。","Stick grenades open the trench for the assault party.\nFour men for close trench fighting, with grenades that can threaten tracks. Distant machine guns can stop their approach; smoke helps them close.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U3","枪声之间，射手辨认敌方机枪的闪光。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪；烟雾、压制和近敌会妨碍瞄准。","Between shots, the marksman watches for a gun flash.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners. Smoke, suppression and close attacks disrupt aim.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U3","挑选出的步枪交给最沉稳的射手。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪，转换目标后需重新瞄准；近战能力有限。","A selected rifle for a steady shot.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners and must settle after changing targets. Vulnerable at close range.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U4","军士把各处枪位纳入同一道命令。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%；停步时每 8 秒缓解压制。重压、离队或阵亡会中断指挥，同类加成不叠加。\n金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。","The sergeant brings the posts under one command.\nNearby troops gain 25% accuracy and rally every 8 seconds while he is halted. Heavy suppression, separation or death breaks command. Bonuses do not stack.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U4","军士穿过交通壕，将零散的枪位重新接起。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%；停步时每 8 秒缓解压制。重压、离队或阵亡会中断指挥，同类加成不叠加。\n金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。","The NCO crosses the communication trench to restore contact.\nNearby troops gain 25% accuracy and rally every 8 seconds while he is halted. Heavy suppression, separation or death breaks command. Bonuses do not stack.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U5","法军喷火手把 Schilt 带到壕口。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命；储罐可能被引燃。","A French flame detachment brings its Schilt to the trench mouth.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal and can ignite the reservoir.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U5","Wex 操作手沿胸墙接近。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命。烟幕能掩护接近，储罐可能被引燃。","The Wex operator closes along the parapet.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal. Smoke covers the approach; the reservoir can ignite.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U6","皇家工兵在铁丝间打开通路。\n清障、排雷，并在掩护下修筑壕肩。第 2 关起，连续施工 12 秒可完成工事；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，连续作业 12 秒可修复半数履带耐久，每侧限一次。接敌或受压制会中断作业。","Royal Engineers open a passage through the wire.\nClear obstacles and mines, and build revetments under cover. From operation 2, 12 uninterrupted seconds complete a post. Two defenders gain 22% protection against frontal bullet hits. Shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores half a track, once per side. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U6","Pioniere 穿过铁丝与未爆弹。\n清障、排雷，并在掩护下修筑壕肩。第 2 关起，连续施工 12 秒可完成工事；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，连续作业 12 秒可修复半数履带耐久，每侧限一次。接敌或受压制会中断作业。","Pioniere work through wire and unexploded shells.\nClear obstacles and mines, and build revetments under cover. From operation 2, 12 uninterrupted seconds complete a post. Two defenders gain 22% protection against frontal bullet hits. Shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores half a track, once per side. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U7","No.23 枪榴弹落向胸墙后方。\n一名枪榴弹射手与两名步枪手。适合打击固定枪位和聚集步兵；散布较大，难以追击分散移动的目标。","A No.23 rifle grenade drops behind the parapet.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen. Suited to fixed guns and infantry concentrations; wide scatter makes dispersed moving targets difficult to hit.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U8","Tankgewehr 的长枪管架上土堤。\n两人反坦克枪组，逐发攻击车体与履带。距离近、入射角正时更易击穿；装填慢，需步兵掩护。","The Tankgewehr rests on an earth bank.\nA two-man crew fires single shots at hulls and tracks. Close, square impacts penetrate more reliably. Slow to reload and dependent on infantry cover.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.Sniper","狙击学校的镜瞄步枪送到前沿。\n一名狙击手与一名步枪观察手。以更远、更准的射击对付固定枪位；烟雾和压制妨碍瞄准，近战兵力不足。","A scoped rifle arrives from sniper school.\nOne sniper and one rifle-armed spotter. Greater range and accuracy threaten fixed guns. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the pair has little strength in close combat.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.Storm","MP 18 的枪声追过下一道壕角。\n以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕。射程短，换弹时火力中断；远射与坦克能阻止突击。","MP 18 fire follows the assault round the traverse.\nAutomatic weapons and grenades excel in close trenches. Short range and reload pauses leave the section vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.Officer","一纸战地委任书，连队多了一名指挥官。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%；军官停步时每 6 秒在较大范围内重整友军。同类加成不叠加，重压或阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒，可为可见目标校射。","A field commission appoints a company officer.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy. While halted, he rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death breaks command.\nWith observation training and an escort, a 2-second halt allows corrections against visible targets.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.Officer","军官跟随前队，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%；每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。指挥范围略小于英军，同类加成不叠加；重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒，可为可见目标校射。","The officer moves with the leading party.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy and rally every 6 seconds, even on the move. His command reaches less far than the British officer's. Bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression breaks command.\nWith survey training and an escort, a 2-second halt allows corrections against visible targets.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("A.0","菱形履带碾过铁丝，侧舱炮朝向敌壕。\nMark IV 雄型以火炮和机枪支援突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需步兵清壕；野炮威胁车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。","Rhomboid tracks crush the wire; sponson guns cover the trench.\nThe Mark IV male supports breakthroughs and engages armour. Slow to advance and reliant on infantry to clear trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can fail separately.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("A.1","Whippet 越过重型坦克留下的车辙。\n机动快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遇到敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。","The Whippet follows the heavy tanks' tracks.\nFast movement and machine guns suit pursuit of exposed infantry. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs gun support against enemy armour.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("A.2","A7V 的炮口守住道路交叉口。\n火炮迎击装甲，多处机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，侧翼需友军掩护；履带和机枪可单独损坏，野炮能摧毁车体。","An A7V covers the road junction.\nIts cannon engages armour and multiple guns suppress infantry. A cumbersome hull needs flank protection. Tracks and guns can fail separately; field artillery can destroy the vehicle.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("A.3","德军识别十字覆盖了旧车号。\n缴获 Mark IV 以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢；野炮与反坦克步枪可毁伤车体，履带和枪位可单独损坏。","German crosses cover the old vehicle number.\nA captured Mark IV supports infantry with cannon and machine guns. Slow-moving and vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and gun positions can fail separately.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("A.4","雌型 Mark IV 的五挺刘易斯扫过胸墙。\n重型机枪坦克，整备快于雄型，行驶远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带与枪位可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。","Five Lewis guns sweep the parapet from a female Mark IV.\nA heavy machine-gun tank, quicker to prepare than the male and much slower than a Whippet. Cannot damage enemy tank hulls. Tracks and guns can fail separately. All armour shares readiness.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("A.5","缴获雌型驶出修理棚，旧侧舱重新装好机枪。\n五处机枪位压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法对抗坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。","A captured female leaves the workshop with its guns refitted.\nFive machine-gun stations suppress infantry concentrations, with shorter preparation than cannon tanks. Cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. All armour shares readiness.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.0","炮长在电话那端复诵方位。\n多轮野炮轰击指定区域。适合固定阵位和集结部队；传令延迟与散布使移动目标较难命中，也会杀伤友军。","The battery repeats the bearing over the wire.\nSeveral salvos cover the selected area. Effective against fixed positions and concentrations; delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets. Friendly troops can be killed.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.1","烟弹在无人区接连破裂。\n两轮烟幕掩护推进或撤离，削弱双方观察与直射火力。炮弹仍能穿过烟幕。","Smoke shells burst across no man's land.\nTwo groups screen an advance or withdrawal, reducing both armies' observation and direct fire. Shells still pass through the smoke.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.3","携弹队把壕炮弹送到炮旁。\n四组迫击炮弹打击固定枪位与拥挤壕道。响应较慢，适合预判敌军集结；落弹也会杀伤友军。","The carrying party brings bombs to the trench mortar.\nFour groups strike fixed guns and crowded trenches. Slow response rewards anticipating enemy concentrations. Friendly troops in the barrage are also at risk.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.4","气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。\n毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤滞留步兵，也会威胁友军。完成佩戴的呼吸器大幅减缓毒气累积。","Gas shells burst. An alarm passes down the trench.\nDrifting clouds obscure sight and kill infantry that remain exposed, including friendly troops. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.5","炮口压低，等待敌车进入射界。\n较快响应的反装甲火力，最多发射 6 发。仅攻击指定区域内可见的装甲；烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离会中断交战。","The gun is laid low for the approaching tank.\nA quick anti-armour response with up to 6 rounds. Engages visible armour inside the selected sector. Smoke, cover or a target leaving the sector interrupts fire.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.6","双翼机压低机头，掠过前沿。\n两次扫射打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，重装甲抵御机枪火力；航线内的友军同样危险。","A biplane dips its nose over the front.\nTwo strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets. Friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.7","炮兵与步兵核对最后一次表针。\n六组弹幕向敌后逐段推进，每组 3 发。压制连续阵位；跟进过近的友军也会遭到炮击。","Gunners and infantry check their watches once more.\nSix groups of 3 shells move the barrage towards the enemy rear. Suppresses successive positions and endangers friendly troops following too closely.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.8","引信装定，榴霰弹在步兵头顶裂开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信操练增至三轮。克制开阔地上的密集步兵，深壕与坚土提供保护。对坦克无效，也会杀伤友军。","Fuzes are set. Shrapnel bursts above the infantry.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells, increased to three salvos by fuze drill. Effective against crowded infantry in the open; deep trenches and earth give protection. Harms allies and cannot damage tanks.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("S.9","炸弹沿既定航线逐枚离架。\n12 枚炸弹覆盖轰炸带，适合固定阵位与密集部队。航线确定后不再追踪目标，友军须离开整条轰炸带。","Bombs leave the racks along the committed run.\nTwelve bombs cover a strip of ground, threatening fixed positions and concentrations. The aircraft does not follow moving targets; friendly troops must clear the entire run.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.0","新兵在靶壕中练习测距与稳枪。\n步枪命中率提高 10%。","Recruits practise range judgement and steady aim.\nRifle hit chance increases by 10%.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.1","桥夹、弹盘与弹带反复装入枪膛。\n各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。","Clips, drums and belts are handled in repeated drills.\nWeapon reload time is reduced by 15%.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.2","短点射压住枪口，下一班趁隙越壕。\n机枪造成的压制提高 18%。","Short bursts pin the guns while the next section crosses.\nMachine-gun suppression increases by 18%.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.3","炮位备好弹药与引信。\n野炮整备时间缩短 15%。","The gun line receives ammunition and fuzes.\nArtillery prepares 15% sooner.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.4","练习壕里留下了投弹手的脚印。\n手雷命中率提高 12%，落点散布不变。","Bombers wear a path through the practice trench.\nGrenade hit chance increases by 12%; impact scatter is unchanged.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.5","补充兵与携弹队分路进入交通壕。\n所有步兵小队整备时间缩短 10%。","Drafts and ammunition parties take separate trench routes.\nAll infantry sections prepare 10% sooner.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T6","刘易斯守住胸墙，步枪班越过空地。\n正在射击的驻壕机枪附近，推进步兵承受的枪弹压制降低 35%。","The Lewis holds the parapet as the rifles cross.\nAdvancing infantry near a firing trench machine gun take 35% less bullet suppression.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T6","军官随突击梯队前移。\n军士晋升为军官，指挥命中加成提高至 50%，每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。","The officer follows the assault echelon.\nPromotes the NCO to an officer: a 50% command accuracy bonus and a rally every 6 seconds, including on the move.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T7","枪手沿胸墙逐段分配火力。\n机枪压制更大范围的邻近敌军，射程不变。","The gunner works his fire along the parapet.\nMachine-gun suppression reaches more troops near the target. Firing range is unchanged.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T7","泥土与护板遮住枪手，射孔只容得下枪口。\n驻壕机枪手遭枪弹命中的机会与承受的压制均降低 25%。","Earth and shields shelter the gunner behind a narrow slit.\nEntrenched machine gunners suffer 25% less bullet hit chance and suppression.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T8","枪手倒下，携弹手接住枪托。\n存活同伴靠近后可接替阵亡机枪手，继续使用刘易斯与剩余弹药。","The gunner falls. A bearer takes the stock.\nA surviving crewman can reach the fallen gunner and take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T8","步枪班出壕，最后一挺机枪继续射击。\n整壕冲锋时，有枪手的机枪组留下掩护。壕内只剩机枪组后，可再次下令前进。","The rifles leave the trench under the last gun's cover.\nA trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews behind. When only the guns remain, a further order sends them forward.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T9","战地委任书送到连部。\n军士晋升为军官，指挥命中加成提高至 50%，范围扩大，每 6 秒重整友军。\n金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。","A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nPromotes the NCO to an officer: a 50% command accuracy bonus, wider reach and a rally every 6 seconds.\nGold marks the commander; silver marks sections under orders.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T9","突击队沿烟幕遮住的低地接近。\n己方烟幕中的推进突击队承受的枪弹压制减半，并接近至更短距离开火。","Assault parties close through the smoke-covered low ground.\nAssault troops advancing inside friendly smoke take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter firing distance.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T10","观察员报出地标，传令兵送回修正。\n指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。","A landmark is sighted and a correction sent back.\nWith a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their target reports.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T10","新坐标记入炮兵测地表。\n迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。","New coordinates enter the battery survey.\nMortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T11","炮位为烟幕后的枪口留下一轮弹药。\n向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。","The battery holds one salvo for the guns behind the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke gains a final follow-up salvo.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T11","守军伏低时，手雷越过胸墙。\n手雷对深受压制的驻壕敌军命中率提高 35%。","Grenades cross the parapet as the defenders crouch.\nGrenades gain 35% hit chance against heavily suppressed entrenched defenders.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T12","镜瞄步枪与结业名册一同送到前沿。\n精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE，射程与精准度提高。","Scoped rifles reach the front with the school roll.\nMarksmen receive scoped SMLEs with greater range and accuracy.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T12","MP 18 配发给率先入壕的突击队。\n突击班换装 MP 18，获得近距离自动火力。1918 年行动可用。","MP 18s go to the first men into the trench.\nAssault sections receive close-range automatic fire. Available in 1918 operations.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T13","瞄准镜停在传令者的手势上。\n狙击手优先瞄准可见的敌军指挥者，其次为机枪手。","The sight settles on a raised signalling hand.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy leaders, then machine gunners.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T13","两处枪位交叉封锁同一条通路。\n分散驻壕、同时射击的机枪形成交叉火力，压制提高 40%。","Two posts cross their fire over one approach.\nSeparated trench machine guns firing together gain 40% suppression.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T14","重整口令追上了越壕的前队。\n近期收到附近指挥组命令的推进步兵，承受的枪弹压制短暂降低 30%。","The rally order reaches the men beyond the parapet.\nRecently rallied advancing infantry briefly take 30% less bullet suppression.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T14","点射尚未停息，枪口已转向下一道壕角。\nMP 18 点射也会压制目标附近的守军。","A burst carries into the next traverse.\nMP 18 bursts also suppress defenders beside the target.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T15","枪声稍歇，桥夹压入弹仓。\n驻壕士兵在低压制、5 秒无目标且弹药不足半数时主动装填。","The firing eases. A fresh clip fills the magazine.\nEntrenched troops below half ammunition reload after 5 seconds without a target, provided suppression is low.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T15","壕里暂时安静，空弹鼓被放到脚边。\n风暴队驻壕、低压制、5 秒无目标且弹药不足半数时主动换弹。","The trench falls quiet. A spent drum is set aside.\nEntrenched storm troops below half ammunition reload after 5 seconds without a target, provided suppression is low.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.16","滤盒离开补给车，面罩逐一检查气密。\n为投弹班、工兵与喷火分遣队配发呼吸器。完成佩戴后，毒气累积减少 78%；仍受压制，久留仍可能致命。其余分队需避开毒区。","Filters are unloaded and each facepiece tested.\nIssues respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. Once sealed, gas exposure falls by 78%. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections must avoid the cloud.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.17","工兵标出引线，携剪钳的人随后跟上。\n工兵排除爆炸物的速度提高 65%。","The sapper marks the wire. The cutters follow.\nPioneers clear explosive hazards 65% faster.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.18","备用燃料从交通壕送到喷火组。\n喷火射程略增；首次燃料耗尽后，可再喷射四次。","Reserve fuel reaches the flame party along the trench.\nFlame reach increases modestly. Four more bursts become available after the first reservoir is exhausted.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.19","炮兵表上的落点挨得更近。\n徐进弹幕各组推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集；炮弹总数不变。","The fire plan brings each lift closer to the last.\nCreeping-barrage groups advance in shorter steps for denser coverage. Shell count is unchanged.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.20","引信装定，预备炮弹推入炮尾。\n榴霰弹支援增至三轮，每轮 3 发。","Fuzes are set and reserve shells brought to the breech.\nShrapnel support gains a third salvo, with 3 shells in each salvo.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.21","求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。\n己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与轰炸任务整备缩短 22%。","A distress signal rises. The reserve ammunition is opened.\nBelow 35 morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel salvos and bombing missions prepare 22% sooner.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T22","反坦克炮沿铁路接近线重新布置。\n铁路行动中，反坦克野炮整备时间缩短 18%。","Anti-tank guns are laid along the railway approaches.\nAnti-tank field guns prepare 18% sooner in railway operations.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T22","修理棚里，补强板铆上列车车体。\n装甲列车车体耐久提高 22%；铁路行动中的反坦克野炮整备缩短 18%。","Reinforcing plates are riveted onto the train.\nArmoured-train hull durability increases by 22%. Anti-tank field guns prepare 18% sooner in railway operations.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.23","老兵领走刚到的补充兵。\n所有步兵整备再缩短 8%，与补给训练叠加。","Veterans take charge of the arriving draft.\nAll infantry prepare a further 8% sooner, combining with supply training.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.T24","枪榴弹的仰角记在射手的本子上。\n枪榴弹落点散布半径缩小 15%。","Rifle-grenade elevations enter the gunner's notebook.\nRifle-grenade scatter radius is reduced by 15%.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.T24","钢板上的弹痕校正了枪组的瞄准。\n反坦克步枪散布缩小 15%，命中后的击穿机会提高。","Strikes on the plate correct the crew's aim.\nAnti-tank rifle scatter is reduced by 15%, with better penetration after a hit.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.25","携弹手把下一发递到枪托旁。\n专门射手附近有存活的同队携弹手时，装填时间缩短 15%。","The next round reaches the gunner's shoulder.\nSpecialist weapons reload 15% faster while a living squadmate remains nearby.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("T.26","电话线铺进刚夺下的交通壕。\n驻守中央之后的第一道敌壕时，间接火力首轮提前 2 秒抵达。","Telephone wire enters the captured communication trench.\nGarrisoning the first enemy trench beyond the centre brings the first indirect-fire salvo 2 seconds sooner.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C0","白垩坡面射界开阔。步兵沿交通壕推进，野炮打击后方集结；末端守军仍须肃清。","Open chalk slopes favour deliberate fire. Advance through the communication trenches and shell rear concentrations; the rear guard must still be cleared.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C0","白垩坡面射界开阔。步兵沿交通壕推进，野炮打击后方集结；末端守军仍须肃清。","Open chalk slopes favour deliberate fire. Advance through the communication trenches and shell rear concentrations; the rear guard must still be cleared.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C1","厂区残墙切断射界。投弹班接近壕角，步枪掩护最后一段空地。","Factory walls break up the sightlines. Bombers close on the traverses while rifles cover the last open approach.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C1","厂区残墙切断射界。投弹班接近壕角，步枪掩护最后一段空地。","Factory walls break up the sightlines. Bombers close on the traverses while rifles cover the last open approach.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C2","中央补给湾可缩短下一轮整备。铁丝缺口狭窄，枪榴弹适合压住守军。","Central stores shorten the next preparation cycle. Narrow wire gaps favour rifle grenades against the defenders.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C2","中央补给湾可缩短下一轮整备。铁丝缺口狭窄，枪榴弹适合压住守军。","Central stores shorten the next preparation cycle. Narrow wire gaps favour rifle grenades against the defenders.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C3","山脊爆破留下陡峭坑岸。炮兵测绘使本关与下一关的首轮火力更早就绪。","The ridge mines leave steep crater rims. Battery survey brings the opening fire forward in this operation and the next.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C3","山脊爆破留下陡峭坑岸。炮兵测绘使本关与下一关的首轮火力更早就绪。","The ridge mines leave steep crater rims. Battery survey brings the opening fire forward in this operation and the next.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C4","中央阵位易手后会出现反击。机枪守住接近线，预备队掩护换防。","The centre draws a counterattack when it changes hands. Guns hold the approaches; reserves cover the relief.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C4","中央阵位易手后会出现反击。机枪守住接近线，预备队掩护换防。","The centre draws a counterattack when it changes hands. Guns hold the approaches; reserves cover the relief.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C5","泥地阻碍补给。迫击炮在本关与下一关优先就绪，首轮野炮稍晚。","Mud delays supply. Mortars receive priority here and in the next operation; the opening field barrage comes later.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C5","泥地阻碍补给。迫击炮在本关与下一关优先就绪，首轮野炮稍晚。","Mud delays supply. Mortars receive priority here and in the next operation; the opening field barrage comes later.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C6","积水分隔混凝土据点，干燥通路狭窄。中央补给湾仍可争夺，迫击炮继续优先供弹。","Floodwater separates the concrete posts, leaving narrow dry routes. Central stores remain contested and mortar supply retains priority.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C6","积水分隔混凝土据点，干燥通路狭窄。中央补给湾仍可争夺，迫击炮继续优先供弹。","Floodwater separates the concrete posts, leaving narrow dry routes. Central stores remain contested and mortar supply retains priority.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C7","林缘与坡脊遮断射界，中央失守会引来反击。毒气可封锁通路；呼吸器需另行研发。","Woodland and ridges break the sightlines. Losing the centre draws a counterattack. Gas can close an approach; respirators require research.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C7","林缘与坡脊遮断射界，中央失守会引来反击。毒气可封锁通路；呼吸器需另行研发。","Woodland and ridges break the sightlines. Losing the centre draws a counterattack. Gas can close an approach; respirators require research.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C8","坚实地面承住履带，密集铁丝仍挡在步兵前方。首轮野炮优先就绪，中央易手后会有反击。","Firm ground carries the tracks, but dense wire still bars the infantry. The opening field barrage has priority; the centre draws a counterattack.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C8","坚实地面承住履带，密集铁丝仍挡在步兵前方。首轮野炮优先就绪，中央易手后会有反击。","Firm ground carries the tracks, but dense wire still bars the infantry. The opening field barrage has priority; the centre draws a counterattack.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C9","林缘出口狭窄，敌方预备队仍在集结。康布雷的炮兵优先令继续生效。","A narrow woodland exit faces gathering reserves. Cambrai artillery priority remains in effect.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C9","林缘出口狭窄，敌方预备队仍在集结。康布雷的炮兵优先令继续生效。","A narrow woodland exit faces gathering reserves. Cambrai artillery priority remains in effect.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C10","冬夜短促出击。只配属轻装分队与烟幕；装甲、重炮和机队不可用。","A short winter raid with light sections and smoke. Armour, heavy guns and aircraft are unavailable.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C10","冬夜短促出击。只配属轻装分队与烟幕；装甲、重炮和机队不可用。","A short winter raid with light sections and smoke. Armour, heavy guns and aircraft are unavailable.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C11","浓雾限制观察，中央补给湾支撑推进。春季优先令提高开场士气，并加快本关与下一关的首轮炮火和烟幕再整备。","Fog restricts observation; central stores sustain the advance. Spring priority raises opening morale and advances the first barrage and smoke rearm here and next operation.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C11","浓雾限制观察，中央补给湾支撑推进。春季优先令提高开场士气，并加快本关与下一关的首轮炮火和烟幕再整备。","Fog restricts observation; central stores sustain the advance. Spring priority raises opening morale and advances the first barrage and smoke rearm here and next operation.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C12","河沟与积水压缩通路。中央争夺会引来反击，春季补给优先令继续生效。","Ditches and floodwater narrow the approaches. Contesting the centre draws a counterattack; spring supply priority remains in effect.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C12","河沟与积水压缩通路。中央争夺会引来反击，春季补给优先令继续生效。","Ditches and floodwater narrow the approaches. Contesting the centre draws a counterattack; spring supply priority remains in effect.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C13","村庄破墙掩护坦克接近，也妨碍炮手观察。步兵保护装甲侧翼，反坦克火力守住路口。","Broken village walls shelter the tanks and obstruct the gunners. Infantry protect the flanks while anti-tank weapons cover the junctions.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C13","村庄破墙掩护坦克接近，也妨碍炮手观察。步兵保护装甲侧翼，反坦克火力守住路口。","Broken village walls shelter the tanks and obstruct the gunners. Infantry protect the flanks while anti-tank weapons cover the junctions.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C14","晨雾掩护装甲展开。应急命令提高开场士气，并提前本关与下一关的首轮炮兵整备。","Morning mist screens the armour. Emergency orders raise opening morale and advance the first battery preparations here and next operation.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C14","晨雾掩护装甲展开。应急命令提高开场士气，并提前本关与下一关的首轮炮兵整备。","Morning mist screens the armour. Emergency orders raise opening morale and advance the first battery preparations here and next operation.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C15","白垩田界布满旧铁丝和未爆弹。工兵清路，徐进弹幕掩护步兵穿越。","Old wire and unexploded shells line the chalk fields. Pioneers clear a route beneath the creeping barrage.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C15","白垩田界布满旧铁丝和未爆弹。工兵清路，徐进弹幕掩护步兵穿越。","Old wire and unexploded shells line the chalk fields. Pioneers clear a route beneath the creeping barrage.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C16","明渠坡岸与密集障碍限制渡越。运河优先令加快烟幕和首轮炮火，中央易手后仍有反击。","Broken canal banks and dense obstacles restrict the crossing. Canal priority advances smoke and opening fire; the centre still draws a counterattack.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C16","明渠坡岸与密集障碍限制渡越。运河优先令加快烟幕和首轮炮火，中央易手后仍有反击。","Broken canal banks and dense obstacles restrict the crossing. Canal priority advances smoke and opening fire; the centre still draws a counterattack.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C17","列车火力守住铁路切口。反装甲武器威胁车体，步兵和工兵沿路堤争夺通路。","Train guns hold the railway cutting. Anti-armour weapons threaten the hull while infantry and pioneers contest the embankment approaches.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C17","列车火力守住铁路切口。反装甲武器威胁车体，步兵和工兵沿路堤争夺通路。","Train guns hold the railway cutting. Anti-armour weapons threaten the hull while infantry and pioneers contest the embankment approaches.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C18","城郊仍有居民，射界受破墙限制。毒气与空中轰炸禁用，烟幕掩护地面推进。","Civilians remain near the town and broken walls restrict sightlines. Gas and aerial bombing are prohibited; smoke covers the ground advance.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C18","城郊仍有居民，射界受破墙限制。毒气与空中轰炸禁用，烟幕掩护地面推进。","Civilians remain near the town and broken walls restrict sightlines. Gas and aerial bombing are prohibited; smoke covers the ground advance.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.C19","最后的渡口仍有守军与预备队。肃清后沿，再让整支分队或整辆战车通过。","Defenders and reserves still hold the final crossing. Clear the rear before bringing a complete section or vehicle through.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.C19","最后的渡口仍有守军与预备队。肃清后沿，再让整支分队或整辆战车通过。","Defenders and reserves still hold the final crossing. Clear the rear before bringing a complete section or vehicle through.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O0","阿拉斯的炮声盖过了城里的钟声。沿白垩路推进，肃清高地后方守军，为后续部队打开通路。","The guns drown the bells of Arras. Advance along the chalk road and clear the defenders beyond the heights, opening a passage for the following troops.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O0","阿拉斯前哨的电话只剩杂音。沿白垩路反击，接回失联的枪位，打通后方交通线。","The Arras outpost telephone carries only static. Counterattack along the chalk road, recover the isolated gun posts and reopen the rear route.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O1","勒厄化工厂仍在德军手中，残墙间的机枪封锁着接近壕。投弹班清理壕角，步枪掩护穿过最后一段空地。","The Roeux chemical works remain in German hands. Guns among the broken walls cover the approach trenches. Bombers clear the traverses while rifles cover the last open crossing.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O1","勒厄化工厂的交通受到威胁。夺回外围接近壕，以破墙间的交叉火力掩护反击。","The route to the Roeux works is threatened. Recover the outer approach trenches, using the broken walls to support the counterattack with crossfire.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O2","四月的残骸仍横在布勒库尔铁丝前，澳军再次投入进攻。枪榴弹压住胸墙，步兵夺取中央补给湾，接通送弹道路。","April's wreckage remains before the Bullecourt wire as the Australians attack again. Rifle grenades cover the parapet; infantry must take the central stores and open the ammunition route.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O2","澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹正落向兴登堡线。守住中央补给湾，以分散枪位封锁铁丝缺口。","The Australians return to Bullecourt. Rifle grenades fall on the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central stores and cover the wire gaps from separated gun posts.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O3","凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。","At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O3","梅西讷的旧壕道埋在爆破后的碎土里。沿新弹坑收拢守军，夺回补给湾，接通仍在开火的支点。","The old Messines trenches lie beneath the debris. Gather the garrison along the new craters, recover the stores and reach the posts still firing.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O4","山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪守住接近线，预备队接应中央阵位。","The new parapets on the ridge are still loose. A counterattack approaches from the east. Guns must hold the approaches, with reserves within reach of the centre.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O4","梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。","Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O5","皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。","Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O5","雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。","Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O6","朗厄马尔克的农场只剩混凝土残墙。迫击炮弹正送往前沿补给湾；夺下补给，压住相互照应的枪位。","Concrete walls are all that remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are moving to the forward stores. Take the supply bay and silence the supporting gun posts.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O6","积水把朗厄马尔克的据点分隔开，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给湾，掩护各枪组换防。","Floodwater separates the Langemarck posts, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the stores and cover the relief of each gun crew.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O7","梅宁路两侧只剩焦黑树桩。炮兵集中支援短距离推进，德军预备队仍在纵深等待。夺取中央后，准备迎击反扑。","Black stumps line the Menin Road. The batteries support a limited advance; German reserves wait farther back. Expect their counterattack when the centre falls.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O7","英军正在梅宁路林缘加固新阵位。气弹已送到炮位，反击队沿掩蔽地段集结。炮火须为接近留出通路。","British troops strengthen their new posts along the Menin woodland edge. Gas shells reach the batteries as counterattack parties assemble under cover. Leave an approach clear for the assault.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O8","康布雷的坚实地面承住了 Mark IV 的履带。坦克压过铁丝，步兵清理遗下的壕道，继续向后方交通线推进。","Firm ground at Cambrai carries the Mark IVs. Tanks crush the wire; infantry clear the trenches behind them and press towards the rear communications.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O8","十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。","On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O9","布尔隆林缘的撤退纵队越来越长。夺回出口旁的交通壕，让机枪掩护最后一批部队通过。","The withdrawing columns lengthen beside Bourlon Wood. Recover the communication trench at the exit and cover the last troops with machine guns.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O9","英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，新的机枪阵位封住了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段逼近林缘出口。","British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient behind newly placed machine guns. Establish battery contact and close on the woodland exit in stages.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O10","冬夜巡逻只带轻装装备。沿低地接近前哨，烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮与机队支援。","The winter patrol travels light. Approach the outpost through low ground and cover exposed stretches with smoke. Armour, heavy guns and aircraft are unavailable.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O10","铁丝前留下了新脚印，前哨尚未回话。轻装分队沿低地接近，烟幕掩护通路；重炮与装甲没有配属。","Fresh tracks stop before the wire. The outpost has not answered. Light sections move through the low ground under smoke cover; heavy guns and armour are not attached.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O11","三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。","On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O11","米夏埃尔攻势的炮火向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进；中央补给湾关系到后续攻势。","The guns of Operation Michael lift deeper. Assault parties pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. The central stores sustain the advance.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O12","利斯河低地的电话中断，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟接起分散支点，夺回道路交叉口。","Telephones fail across the Lys lowlands. The Portuguese sector has been breached. Link the scattered posts along the ditches and recover the road junction.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O12","乔治特攻势穿过河沟与低地。送弹队仍在后方涉水；机枪和突击队须互相接应，打开下一段道路。","Operation Georgette crosses ditches and low ground. Ammunition parties struggle through the water behind. Guns and assault troops must support each other into the next approach.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O13","德军已攻入维莱布勒托讷，英军坦克正在村外交战。夺回通往亚眠的道路；澳军将在夜间反击。","German troops have entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fight outside the village. Recover the road to Amiens before the Australian night counterattack.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O13","维莱布勒托讷的进攻已进入村庄，英军坦克从近郊开火。步兵守住装甲两侧，夺取通往亚眠的出口。","The assault has entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fire from the outskirts. Cover the armour's flanks and take the exit towards Amiens.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O14","八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。","At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O14","亚眠的前沿接连失去联络。缴获坦克与 Tankgewehr 组抵达，机枪掩护后卫；为撤出的部队重新打开交通。","Forward posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured tanks and Tankgewehr teams arrive under the rearguard's machine guns. Reopen communications for the withdrawing troops.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O15","斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。","Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O15","撤退道路重新穿过旧阵地，铁丝挡住了己方接近线。工兵开路，Wex 分队与机枪掩护局部反击。","The withdrawal returns to old positions, where wire now blocks the German approach. Pioneers clear it while Wex crews and machine guns cover local counterattacks.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O16","里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。","The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O16","运河纤道仍能通行，两侧枪位保持联络。工兵照看通路，预备队准备夺回失守的中央阵位。","The canal towpath remains open and the bank guns are still in contact. Pioneers tend the route; reserves stand ready to retake the centre if it falls.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O17","塞勒河切口里的列车仍在掩护撤运。工兵清出接近线，反装甲火力打击车载枪炮，步兵沿路堤展开。","A train in the Selle cutting covers the evacuation. Pioneers clear the approach, anti-armour fire engages the rail guns and infantry spread along the embankment.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O17","塞勒河车站仍在装车，列车炮组留在切口。步兵掩护车载枪炮的侧翼，守住通往河岸的道路。","Loading continues at the Selle station while the train guns hold the cutting. Infantry cover their flanks and hold the road to the riverbank.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O18","瓦朗谢讷城内仍有平民。加拿大军逼近城郊，本连夺取外围道路；毒气与空中轰炸不予配属。","Civilians remain in Valenciennes as Canadian troops approach. The company is to take the outer roads. Gas and aerial bombing are not authorised.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O18","军车与平民挤在瓦朗谢讷城外道路上。后卫守住出口，以烟幕掩护换防；毒气与空中轰炸不予配属。","Army wagons and civilians crowd the road outside Valenciennes. The rear guard holds the exits under smoke cover. Gas and aerial bombing are not authorised.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.O19","十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火；肃清后沿，掩护后续部队通过。城郊禁止毒气与空中轰炸。","On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach the walls of Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the rear for the following troops. Gas and aerial bombing are prohibited near the town.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.O19","南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在开火。机枪守住桑布尔渡口，预备队掩护最后的通路。城郊禁止毒气与空中轰炸。","News of the southern armistice has arrived. The Western Front still fires. Machine guns hold the Sambre crossing while reserves cover the last route. Gas and aerial bombing are prohibited near the town.")

WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U9","刘易斯随步枪班逐段换位。\n一名机枪手与三名步枪手，必须停稳架枪后开火。移动较快，架设与收枪快 30%；射程与压制弱于固定枪组。","The Lewis moves forward with the rifles.\nOne machine gunner and three riflemen; the gun must halt and deploy to fire. Moves faster, with 30% faster deployment and packing. Range and suppression are lower than the fixed section's.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U9","MG 08/15 跟上突击队的脚步。\n一名机枪手与三名步枪手，必须停稳架枪后开火。移动较快，架设与收枪快 30%；射程与压制弱于固定枪组。","The MG 08/15 follows the assault.\nOne machine gunner and three riflemen; the gun must halt and deploy to fire. Moves faster, with 30% faster deployment and packing. Range and suppression are lower than the fixed section's.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("B.U10","地图摊开，传令兵等候炮火修正。\n与同伴停稳 2 秒并看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布减少 30%。移动、烟雾、重压或同伴阵亡会中断校射。","The map is opened and the runner waits for a correction.\nHalt with an escort for 2 seconds with a clear view: the first artillery or mortar salvo arrives 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter. Movement, smoke, heavy suppression or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("G.U10","观察员报出地标，传令兵记下方位。\n与同伴停稳 2 秒并看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布减少 30%。移动、烟雾、重压或同伴阵亡会中断校射。","The observer calls a landmark; the runner notes the bearing.\nHalt with an escort for 2 seconds with a clear view: the first artillery or mortar salvo arrives 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter. Movement, smoke, heavy suppression or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("Name.MobileUK","Lewis 机动枪组","Lewis Assault Section")
WFV43_MESSAGE("Name.MobileDE","MG 08/15 伴随枪组","MG 08/15 Accompanying Section")
WFV43_MESSAGE("Name.SignalsUK","炮兵前沿观测组","Forward Observation Party")
WFV43_MESSAGE("Name.SignalsDE","Artilleriebeobachter 观测组","Artilleriebeobachter Party")

WFV43_MESSAGE("Research.Training","战绩点用于研习条令。需先完成所列前置训练；装备随战役配属开放。","Use earned points to learn doctrines. Complete the listed training first; equipment follows campaign assignments.")

WFV43_MESSAGE("T.27","枪械与弹药分给更多携行手。\n解锁伴随机枪编组：移动较快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制较弱。\n在整备页与固定枪组互换，共用岗位和整备；只影响之后征募的分队。","More bearers share the gun and ammunition.\nUnlocks a mobile gun section: faster movement and 30% faster deployment and packing, with less range and suppression.\nExchange it with the fixed section in the loadout. Both share a slot and readiness; the choice applies to new recruits.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("V52.TechUK","刘易斯突击编组","Lewis assault organisation")
WFV43_MESSAGE("V52.TechDE","随步兵前进的机枪","The accompanying gun")
WFV43_MESSAGE("V52.VariantTip","固定枪组射程远、压制强；伴随枪组移动与架设快。共用整备，切换只影响之后征募的分队。","Fixed sections offer range and suppression; mobile sections move and deploy faster. They share readiness. Switching affects new recruits.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("V52.Command25","金星：指挥者；银星：接受命令。\n附近友军命中率提高25%，不叠加。军士阵亡、受重压或离开范围即失效。","Gold: commander. Silver: under orders.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy, without stacking. The bonus ends if the NCO dies, is heavily suppressed or leaves command range.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("V52.Command50","金星：指挥者；银星：接受命令。\n附近友军命中率提高50%，不叠加。军官阵亡、受重压或离开范围即失效。","Gold: commander. Silver: under orders.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy, without stacking. The bonus ends if the officer dies, is heavily suppressed or leaves command range.")
WFV43_MESSAGE("V52.SignalsRetired","校射由完成观察研习的指挥组承担。","Command sections carry out observation after the required training.")


